      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "While the manuscript mentions conducting 'structured syntheses' and re-analyzing data, it does not explicitly specify how studies were grouped for these syntheses or link them to the comparisons defined in the objectives."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_27",
      "quote": "This is mostly due to our restriction to only include studies with a robust study design (eg, CBA or ITS studies).",
      "reason": "The authors provide a rationale for restricting study eligibility to robust study designs (CBA or ITS)."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 95
